{"doc_id":"REPORT-news_r-04709-00001","summaries":{"A":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":2,"utility":2,"evidence":["의성 9명, 안동 5명, 영주·영덕·예천 각 1명이다.","다른 1명은 서울에 사는 가이드다."],"reason":"The sentence 'each 1 person ... is a guide living in Seoul' garbles the region counts and the guide, so the relation is wrong. It omits the unclear infection route, the mask use, and the post-return activities."},"B":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":0,"wrong_unit_qualifier":0,"entity_relation":0,"fluency":4,"utility":3,"evidence":["39명의 순례단은 이스라엘 현지에서도 전용 버스를 타고 마스크를 낀 채 이동했다","감염 경로가 너무 애매해 내부적으로 자체 조사를 벌이고 있다"],"reason":"Counts, the guide and the unclear infection route are accurate, and the mask detail is included. It omits the community-spread concern and the confirmed cases' movements after returning home."},"C":{"adequacy":3,"critical_unsupported":0,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":1,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":3,"utility":3,"evidence":["지난 8~16일 이스라엘 성지순례에 참여한 경북도민 39명(가이드 1명 서울 포함) 가운데 18명","“출국할 때만 해도 이스라엘에서는 중국인이나 14일 이내에 중국을 경유한 사람은 입국을 금지하고 있었다”"],"reason":"The wording '확진 확진' is redundant. It presents 39 as all confirmed-case people, which blurs the scope, and it drops the guide. It also turns the cleared-at-departure remark into a claim that Israel was a 'clean area', which the source states separately. It omits the unclear route and the post-return movements."},"D":{"adequacy":2,"critical_unsupported":1,"critical_omission":1,"wrong_unit_qualifier":1,"entity_relation":1,"fluency":2,"utility":2,"evidence":["의성의 B씨(53·여)는 17일 낮 12시40분쯤 안계면 홈마트를 방문","이 밖에도 다른 확진자들은 각각 영주온천랜드, 의성경북의원, 안동소방서 등을 방문했다."],"reason":"It says the 18 people 'were included in the pilgrimage group' with guide miscounted, and it merges B with all 18 confirmed cases, attributing the venue visits to them wrongly. It omits the unclear route and the early-symptom case."}}}
